---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Marker from '../components/Marker.astro';
import Credentials from '../components/Credentials.astro';
import Portrait from '../components/Portrait.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<Base title="About" description={site.description}>
  <section class="shell band-tight" style="padding-top: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 2rem;">
      <Portrait size="sm" />
      <h1>About</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose stack" style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <p class="lede">
        I am a venture capital investor at Merak Capital in Riyadh, where I work across the Tech and
        Gaming funds. Before that I spent close to seven years at Bain &amp; Company. I write about
        how both of those worlds actually operate, and I coach people trying to get into them.
      </p>

      <p>
        At Merak I own the deal lifecycle end to end — sourcing across the GCC and global tech and
        gaming ecosystems, running commercial and competitive diligence, building the investment
        thesis and taking it to committee, then supporting terms and closing. After the wire, the
        work changes shape: I partner with founders on strategy, follow-on fundraising, hiring, and
        the partnerships that open commercial doors in the region. My coverage is Saudi Arabia, the
        UAE, and the wider GCC.
      </p>

      <p>
        Before venture I was at Bain, most recently as a Senior Project Leader running deal and
        strategy work for private equity clients across healthcare, fintech, and retail and
        e-commerce, with teams of six to eight. Much of it was commercial due diligence on
        acquisition and exit decisions, alongside growth and go-to-market strategy across the UAE,
        Saudi Arabia, and Southeast Asia. Earlier in that stretch I built portfolio strategy for a
        sovereign wealth fund and screened targets across APAC and EMEA.
      </p>

      <p>
        I am a CFA Charterholder with an MBA in finance and strategy from IIM Udaipur, including an
        exchange at EDHEC, and a B.Com from Hansraj College.
      </p>

      <p>
        The coaching started at Board Infinity, where I worked with more than twenty IIM graduates on
        resumes and interview preparation. I kept doing it because the gap between a strong candidate
        and a successful one is usually small, specific, and fixable — and almost nobody tells them
        what it is. Having screened candidates from the hiring side and sat the same interviews
        myself, I can usually name it in one session.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>A note from Claude:</strong> everything above is drawn from your LinkedIn profile.
        It is accurate but generic in voice. Rewrite it in your own — particularly the last
        paragraph, where the reason you coach is the thing a prospective client is really reading
        for.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell band-tight">
    <Marker label="In short" />
    <Credentials />
  </section>

  <section class="shell band-tight">
    <Marker label="Elsewhere" />
    <ul class="prose" style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
      {
        site.links.map((link) => (
          <li style="margin-top: 0.6rem;">
            <a href={link.href} rel="me noopener">{link.label}</a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
      <li style="margin-top: 0.6rem;">
        <a href={site.calendly} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a call</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
